    "detailed_description": "This is a fun &amp; amazing tower crush game! Crush enemy's towers, take over the empire!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25cf Fight: Connect all your buildings together to grow them taller and then takeover the enemy's buildings.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25cf Control: Simple drag controls from one building to another.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25cf Build: Build your empire, occupy more territory, crush your opponents.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25cf Heroes: Recruit legendary heroes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25cf Special art style: Lowpoly Style Game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25cf 2 Special Mode:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n#1 Stage Maker Mode: design levels by yourself and share it to your family, your friends or all the worldwide players.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n#2 Offline Mode: play levels even you have no network.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGood luck, I wish you will like this game!",
